  "title": "Etcd peer communication failures",
  "severity": "warning",
  "description": "Etcd member is experiencing more than 0.01 failed peer sends per second to peer, which usually indicates the member is unreachable or network-partitioned.",
  "tags": [
    "awesome-prometheus-alerts",
